### Expert Listing API — request collection
### Point @baseUrl at local or production before running any request below.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
# @baseUrl = https://expert-listing-backend.vercel.app/api/v1

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Unknown route -> 404 envelope
GET {{baseUrl}}/nope

### Request id echoed when supplied
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
X-Request-Id: my-test-id

### --- GET /posts -------------------------------------------------------

### Basic shape: 3 hydrated items, pagination present
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?limit=3

### Default limit (20)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts

### Filter: single post_type
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?post_type=property

### Filter: csv post_type
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?post_type=property,request

### Filter: transaction_type
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?transaction_type=for_rent

### Filter: has_media=true
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?has_media=true

### Filter: has_media=false
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?has_media=false

### Filter: min_bedrooms
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?min_bedrooms=3

### Filter: posted_within
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?posted_within=24h

### Two filters combine with AND
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?post_type=property&transaction_type=for_rent

### Filters persist across a cursor page (run once, copy pagination.next_cursor
### from the response into the cursor param below, keeping post_type)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?post_type=property&limit=2

### GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?post_type=property&limit=2&cursor=<paste next_cursor here>

### Pagination sweep manually, page 1 of N (limit=7)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?limit=7

### --- Errors -------------------------------------------------------------

### Malformed cursor -> 400 INVALID_CURSOR
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?cursor=garbage

### Invalid enum value -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR with field_errors
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?post_type=nonsense

### Unknown query param -> 400 (schema is .strict())
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?unknown_param=x

### limit=999 clamps to 50 (pagination.limit will read 50)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?limit=999

### limit=0 -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?limit=0

### min_price > max_price -> 400 with a field error
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?min_price=500&max_price=100
